-all large `q`: for every finite family of entries of height at most `T ≤ (log q)/3` under the
-safe-anchor hypothesis at height `2T + 1`, and every `a ≥ 0`,
-`(Σ a_j R_j)_+² ≤ (1 + η) I_B [Σ_j (D(δ_j) - d₁ + e_j) a_j² + (d₁ + η)(Σ_j a_j)²]`.
